Bind Npc 31572 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31571 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 686 "Twisted Flow of Mana"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Senior Researcher] Gaaz."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Senior Researcher] Aldos."

Requires player level >= 65 and quest 675 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Chief Researcher] Gaz is in Islant. He's doing a research on magic at the [Magic Soceity]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Chief Researcher] Aldos is in Islant. He's doing a research on magic at the [Magic Soceity]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "What do you want? Unless it's urgent, leave me alone."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The leader? I see. Let me explain to you. There have been some strange movements of magical creatures in Islant. And I'm here to invetigate by collecting specimen and conducting a research.g specimen.\n\nBy specimen, I mean magical creatures in whose body [Mana Piece] is already finished crystalizing. And I collect and analyze them. <selfname>, it would mean a great deal if you could collect [Mana Piece] and bring them back to me.\n\nWe need to talk to [Senior Researcher]Gaz."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "What do you want? Unless it's urgent, leave me alone."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The leader? I see. Let me explain to you. There have been some strange movements of magical creatures in Islant. And I'm here to invetigate by collecting specimen and conducting a research.g specimen.\n\nBy specimen, I mean magical creatures in whose body [Mana Piece] is already finished crystalizing. And I collect and analyze them. <selfname>, it would mean a great deal if you could collect [Mana Piece] and bring them back to me.\n\nWe need to talk to [Senior Researcher]Aldos."

On claimable
    Show quest "If you have decided to help me, please first bring me the apparatus. I need a catalyst called [Potion of Soul] and [Magician's Stone] to test its reaction to pure magic. You can get them from [Potion Merchant] and [Store] respectively. Please hurry."
